      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing some very unsettling feelings about your online presence. To begin spotting differences, analyze the content for shifts in unique personal quirks, emotional tone, or specific inside jokes that your actual friends would recognize. Pay close attention to how your \"self\" reacts to unexpected situations online; a programmed replica might lack the genuine unpredictability of your real emotions. If the digital interactions feel consistently hollow or slightly \"off,\" that is a key area to investigate.",
